i've gotten this Game on 2012, 1 year after it came out, some friends bought it for my big brother, and i fell in love with it.
The way it is actually designed it just makes it gorgeous. The Music can be relaxing and calm, or maybe Exciting and fast. How the developers got the Sandbox style into terraria is great, and its variety of things to do is Amazing. It has some really original Bosses and Mobs and you NEED to have skills to play this, and the Game itself alredy makes you a Master. I definitely recommend you to buy it, its 100% Worth. have fun :)

if you think you might get bored a bunch of hours of playing it, take a look at me, i've played it 1.468 Hours from the past 5 years and i still love it. ;)

